Subject: [PATCH] mutter: add no-native-backend fallback for GIR builds

The on-device introspection builder does not mount the Xios backend source tree,
but it still configures Mutter with the native backend disabled. Keep that
standalone GIR path buildable by giving the no-native-backend branch an
unreachable fallback body.

diff -ruN -U0 a/src/core/meta-context-main.c b/src/core/meta-context-main.c
--- a/src/core/meta-context-main.c	2024-03-16 06:43:07
+++ b/src/core/meta-context-main.c	2026-07-06 16:41:08
@@ -517,0 +518,3 @@
+#else
+      g_assert_not_reached ();
+      return NULL;
